[FINAL-TEXT] **Definitive evidence:**

| Check | Result |
|---|---|
| `r3.eth0` state | **DOWN** (no `LOWER_UP`, no `UP` flag) |
| `carrier_changes` on r3.eth0 | **2** — consistent with: UP at startup → one DOWN event (static fault, not oscillating) |
